
Programa chʼuya: 1.
Programa yuyay: 16000000.
>> tokens := ['{}↲.:,x() '].
{ :i
	>> codigo := [''].
	>> x := Yupay chawpi: 1 wan: 10.
	{
		>> y := Yupay chawpi: 1 wan: (tokens suni).
		codigo yapay-qhepaman: (tokens simi: y).
	} × x.
	{ Ruway musuq: codigo. } hapiy: { ['Empty']. }, kallpay.

} × 10000.
Lluqsiy qillqay: ['OK'], sayay.
